From 9388a10372d2ddfaefd9fa1814405692c75eeea6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Build tooling contributors <build-tools@example.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 12:25:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: export durable native test outputs

The built-in runner exposes no output declarations to command-line users,
and remote materializations expire when the test session ends. CI cannot
retain captures after a single native test invocation.

Add opt-in output declarations through the public test API and copy returned
local outputs while their lease is live. Export actual statuses and durable
paths in a versioned NUL manifest, keeping existing invocations unchanged.
